OT	And from the children of Israel's half you shall take one of every fifty, drawn from the persons, the cattle, the donkeys, and the sheep, from all the livestock, and give them to the Levites who keep charge of the tabernacle of the LORD.

You shall mark out your eastern border from Hazar Enan to Shepham;
OT	the border shall go down from Shepham to Riblah on the east side of Ain; the border shall go down and reach to the eastern side of the Sea of Chinnereth;
OT	the border shall go down along the Jordan, and it shall end at the Salt Sea. This shall be your land with its surrounding boundaries.'

These are the names of the men who shall divide the land among you as an inheritance: Eleazar the priest and Joshua the son of Nun.
OT	These are the names of the men: from the tribe of Judah, Caleb the son of Jephunneh;
OT	from the tribe of the children of Simeon, Shemuel the son of Ammihud;
