NT	Behold, you despisers, Marvel and perish! For I work a work in your days, A work which you will by no means believe, Though one were to declare it to you."'

Their feet are swift to shed blood;
NT	Destruction and misery are in their ways;
NT	And the way of peace they have not known.

He shall rule them with a rod of iron; They shall be dashed to pieces like the potter's vessels'--as I also have received from My Father;
